  "interactionChecks": [
    "Unknown query falls back; cancelled group opens a read-only roster; Escape restores focus",
    "Add and remove update members, row readiness and history inside the open drawer, without a toast",
    "Failed addition keeps editable input and retry adds that input",
    "Busy add and removal cannot repeat or close",
    "Full, above-maximum and awaiting-terms explain unavailable adding; conflict reload shows the latest roster",
    "Load failure shows no stale members and can retry; keyboard focus wraps in the drawer",
    "Layout checked at 699, 700 and 1920 px; drawer is full screen below 700 px and 480 px otherwise"
  ],
  "limitations": "Static review fixtures: no backend, persistence, real concurrency or production accessibility certification. Busy states deliberately remain in progress."
}
